==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*10 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 43.33~50 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,500f</sup>.
*15 [[Croco]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*2 [[Rain D.|Rain Ds]] spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 86.67~90 seconds<sup>2,600f~2,700f</sup>.
*1 [[Ragin' Gory]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*4 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The main threats here are the 3 Dark Otters that appear here. A decent anti-Dark unit can solve this stage very easily. Ragin' Gory usually does not require additional investment beyond what is used against Dark Otter. Rain D is easily repelled by ranged attackers.

